      "heading": "A - Exam authority, Your Vehicle",
      "learner_facing": true,
      "markdown": "## A - Exam authority, Your Vehicle\n\nThis dossier supports first-time never-licensed applicants preparing for the Class E knowledge exam in Florida. The issuing authority is the Florida Department of Highway Safety and Motor Vehicles. Handbook facts in this section come from the Before You Drive vehicle chapter of the Official Florida Driver License Handbook. The official question count, test format, time limit, and passing standard are not stated on the assigned pages, so this dossier asserts no value for any of them. Practice scoring follows only the accepted LearningLoop product policy.\n",
